# Octofit Tracker Frontend Environment Configuration

# IMPORTANT: Set VITE_CODESPACE_NAME for Codespaces support
# In Codespaces: Create .env.local with your Codespace name
# Example: VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=my-codespace-name
#
# Without VITE_CODESPACE_NAME, the app will fallback to http://localhost:8000
# This is useful for local development without a Codespace.

# Codespaces Environment (set in .env.local or by Codespaces)
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name-here

# API Configuration
# API Base URL will be constructed as:
# - Codespaces: https://${VITE_CODESPACE_NAME}-8000.app.github.dev
# - Local: http://localhost:8000
